<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's EDP says 1996 cons net 80-81 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Portugal's EDP says 1996 cons net 80-81 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese state-owned utility EDP-Electricidade de Portugal posted a consolidated net profit of between 80 and 81 billion escudos in 1996, up from 66.3 billion in 1995, its president Antonio de Almeida said.</p>
</text>
